00:35:01.939 --> 00:35:01.979
Well,

00:35:02.060 --> 00:35:02.780
there's some fun

00:35:03.030 --> 00:35:05.739
sort of trivia embedded even in this cheat sheet.

00:35:05.820 --> 00:35:07.300
So here again is A,

00:35:07.379 --> 00:35:07.540
B,

00:35:07.620 --> 00:35:07.820
