00:35:21.300 --> 00:35:23.719
the consistent pattern between these two?

00:35:24.739 --> 00:35:25.209
Yeah,

00:35:25.370 --> 00:35:27.959
so the lowercase letters are 32

00:35:28.239 --> 00:35:28.679
away

00:35:28.919 --> 00:35:29.949
from the uppercase letters.

00:35:30.050 --> 00:35:30.090
Well,

00:35:30.169 --> 00:35:30.879
how do we know that?

00:35:31.010 --> 00:35:31.090
Well,

00:35:31.129 --> 00:35:33.010
